- PAH-like: -10

### E) Drug-likeness
- MW 250-650: +4 else -6
- TPSA 50-140: +4; >170: -10
- HBA 4-11 AND HBD 0-3: +3 else -4
- |charge| <2: +2 else -12
- QED ≥0.35: +2 else -3
- Poorly soluble: -6

### F) Alert penalties
